{\b\fs22 Hostbay}\par
\par
Hostbay manages the game servers on this PC: it finds them in your Steam libraries, edits their config files, starts and stops them, and shows their logs.\par
\par
It installs for your Windows user only, into %LOCALAPPDATA%\\Programs\\Hostbay, and adds Start menu and desktop shortcuts. Uninstall it any time from Settings > Apps. Your server list and settings in %APPDATA%\\Hostbay are kept when you uninstall.\par
\par
Hostbay is provided as is, without warranty of any kind. Keep backups of your server worlds.\par
